00:14:05.670 --> 00:14:07.460
WENDY KAN: Yep, correct,
you can do that.

00:14:07.460 --> 00:14:09.210
It's not just for
machine learning, right?

00:14:09.210 --> 00:14:10.350
You could do anything.

00:14:10.350 --> 00:14:12.570
You could do
