00:14:43.475 --> 00:14:44.100
WENDY KAN: Yes.

00:14:44.100 --> 00:14:45.450
MARK MANDEL: So they're
community-powered.

00:14:45.450 --> 00:14:46.450
That's really cool.

00:14:46.450 --> 00:14:49.110
So we keep mentioning kernels,
