00:20:56.430 --> 00:21:00.540
WENDY KAN: Keras is a
higher-level framework

00:21:00.540 --> 00:21:02.820
for using deep learning.

00:21:02.820 --> 00:21:05.220
It's great that
people love to use it,

00:21:05.220 --> 00:21:08.720
