00:21:14.880 --> 00:21:19.020
and it's very easy to use.

00:21:19.020 --> 00:21:21.540
And what's great
about it is that it

00:21:21.540 --> 00:21:24.940
can connect to different
frameworks on the lower level,

00:21:24.940 --> 00:21:25.440
too.

00:21:25.440 --> 00:21:29.520
So it's very heavily used
by Kaggle communities.

00:21:29.520 --> 00:21:34.680
And you'll see a lot of Keras
usage on Kaggle Kernels,

00:21:34.680 --> 00:21:37.410
and just generally,
people use it a lot.

00:21:37.410 --> 00:21:38.660
And I know the author--

00:21:38.660 --> 00:21:40.642
