00:22:10.020 --> 00:22:11.654
other than TensorFlow
[INAUDIBLE],,

00:22:11.654 --> 00:22:12.570
but I'm sure there is.

00:22:12.570 --> 00:22:14.130
WENDY KAN: There are.

00:22:14.130 --> 00:22:19.350
Kaggle wants to remain very
neutral on these tools.

00:22:19.350 --> 00:22:22.720
We want people to use whatever
tools that they prefer.

00:22:22.720 --> 00:22:24.450
So we don't specify.

00:22:24.450 --> 00:22:27.540
We don't push for
people to use anything,

00:22:27.540 --> 00:22:29.760
because people should
feel free to use

00:22:29.760 --> 00:22:31.260
